<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Slay-Bags Showcase</title>
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Segoe+UI:wght@400;600&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        background: url("pink.jpeg") no-repeat center center fixed;
        background-size: cover;
        color: #333;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      body::before {
        content: "";
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
        z-index: -1;
      }

      header {
        background: linear-gradient(to right, deeppink, hotpink);
        padding: 40px 20px;
        text-align: center;
        color: white;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      }
      header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
      }
      header p {
        margin-top: 10px;
        font-style: italic;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }

      nav {
        background: rgba(192, 192, 192, 0.95);
        padding: 15px;
        text-align: center;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      }
      nav a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: deeppink;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin: 0 15px;
        font-size: 16px;
        transition:
          color 0.3s,
          transform 0.2s;
      }
      nav a:hover {
        color: black;
        transform: scale(1.1);
      }

      main {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        padding: 0 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      #main-title {
        color: purple;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        font-size: 2rem;
      }
      .sub-title {
        color: deeppink;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
      }
      .section-title {
        color: hotpink;
        margin-top: 30px;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .text-paragraph {
        margin: 15px auto;
        font-size: 16px;
        text-align: justify;
      }

      #highlighted-paragraph {
        margin: 25px auto;
        font-size: 17px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: deeppink;
        background: #ffe6f2;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }

      #final-paragraph {
        margin: 25px auto;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-style: italic;
        color: purple;
      }

      footer {
        background: linear-gradient(to right, silver, pink);
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        color: deeppink;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-top: 40px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <h1>SLAY-BAGS</h1>
      <p>Luxury. Style. Confidence.</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="#">Shop</a>
      <a href="#">Offers</a>
      <a href="#">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <main>
      <h1 id="main-title">Slay-Bags: Where Style Meets Purpose</h1>
      <h2 class="sub-title">Discover the Unique Touch</h2>
      <h3 class="section-title">Our Bags' Distinctiveness</h3>
      <h4 class="section-title">Why Choose Us?</h4>

      <p class="text-paragraph">
        Each Slay-Bag is handcrafted with precision, blending modern fashion
        with timeless designs. No two bags are exactly alike, making every piece
        a unique statement.
      </p>

      <p class="text-paragraph">
        Our materials are carefully selected for durability and luxury, ensuring
        that every bag lasts long while keeping its elegant look. This adds
        incredible value to your investment.
      </p>

      <p id="highlighted-paragraph">
        Slay-Bags don’t just look good—they empower. By choosing our bags, you
        support local artisans and sustainable practices, creating a meaningful
        impact in the community.
      </p>

      <p class="text-paragraph">
        The design of each bag considers functionality and style, making them
        perfect for work, events, or casual outings. You carry both practicality
        and sophistication wherever you go.
      </p>

      <p class="text-paragraph">
        Our customers often say that owning a Slay-Bag boosts their confidence
        and elevates their personal style. Each bag tells a story that sets you
        apart from the crowd.
      </p>

      <p id="final-paragraph">
        With every Slay-Bag, you invest in uniqueness, quality, and purpose.
        Experience the joy of owning a bag that is more than an accessory—it’s a
        symbol of value and impact.
      </p>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>© 2026 Slay-Bags</p>
      <p>Contact: +254 712 345 678</p>
      <p>Instagram: @slaybags</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
